{"id":"amabilidad","lemma":"amabilidad","pos":"noun","rank":3796,"glosses":["kindness"],"ipa":"/amabiliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"amabilidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-amabilidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Muchas gracias por tu amabilidad.","en":"Thank you very much for all your kindness.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/833040","words":[null,null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"your"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"Thank you very much"]]},{"text":"No puedo olvidar su amabilidad.","en":"I can't forget his kindness.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586885","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to forget"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Ella tuvo la amabilidad de ayudarme.","en":"She had the kindness to help me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687672","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to help","l":"ayudar"}]},{"text":"No podemos confiar en su amabilidad.","en":"We cannot rely on her kindness.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684345","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to reassure"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Nunca olvidaré tu amabilidad.","en":"I'll never forget your kindness.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524822","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to forget","l":"olvidar"},{"g":"your"},null]}]}